128, 32], 'tower_hidden_units': [128, 64], 'routing': 'task', 'feedback_in_score': True, 'selector_gradient': 'primary', 'auxiliary_selector': 'none', 'block_aux_context_gradient': False, 'auxiliary_item_mode': 'private'} Trainable private item/action tables, initialized as exact copies after inherited reset; shared by three auxiliary heads. Primary selector, shared context and all tower widths retained. Auxiliaries train their private target/history values and score rows, never the primary item tables or score trunk. No measured result yet.\ng3-r0005-fixed_aux_items g3-r0003-embedding_item_primary success 0.6604035936565 384.14036490023136 {'embedding_dim': 16, 'attention_hidden_units': [128, 32], 'tower_hidden_units': [128, 64], 'routing': 'task', 'feedback_in_score': True, 'selector_gradient': 'primary', 'auxiliary_selector': 'none', 'block_aux_context_gradient': False, 'auxiliary_item_mode': 'fixed'} Same copied item/action tables and lookups, but private embeddings run under no_grad and remain at initialization. Tests learned adaptation beyond a fixed initial basis; this is not an incumbent reproduction. Allocated capacity matches the candidate; active capacity and backward cost differ.\ng3-r0005-tied_primary_items g3-r0003-embedding_item_primary success 0.660163362657485 382.01652759313583 {'embedding_dim': 16, 'attention_hidden_units': [128, 32], 'tower_hidden_units': [128, 64], 'routing': 'task', 'feedback_in_score': True, 'selector_gradient': 'primary', 'auxiliary_selector': 'none', 'block_aux_context_gradient': False, 'auxiliary_item_mode': 'tied_primary'} Auxiliary heads read detached current primary target/history values; copied tables allocated and looked up but unused. Functional and gradient reproduction control for g3-r0003-embedding_item_primary, with added allocation/forward cost. Must reproduce archived metrics before interpretation.\ng3-r0005-tied_joint_items g3-r0003-embedding_item_primary success 0.6583355808266143 390.7988428622484 {'embedding_dim': 16, 'attention_hidden_units': [128, 32], 'tower_hidden_units': [128, 64], 'routing': 'task', 'feedback_in_score': True, 'selector_gradient': 'primary', 'auxiliary_selector': 'none', 'block_aux_context_gradient': False, 'auxiliary_item_mode': 'tied_joint'} Auxiliary heads read live current primary target/history values; copied tables allocated and looked up but unused. Functional and gradient reproduction control for g3-r0004-joint_hook_control and g3-r0003-embedding_joint. Default summed BCE replaces the explicit identical unit-weight hook; verify equivalence. Shared selector trunk remains click-owned.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
